=== meta ===
rule: EXPECTATION_DEFINITION_CHANGED
title: rewriting a bare-name membership set is still an expectation edit
origin: T1.10 — `assert x in allowed`; the haystack is the oracle, not a producer attribute
=== before: tests/test_allowed.py ===
def test_allowed():
    x = 1
    allowed = {1, 2}
    assert x in allowed
=== after: tests/test_allowed.py ===
def test_allowed():
    x = 1
    allowed = {1, 2, 3}
    assert x in allowed
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "EXPECTATION_DEFINITION_CHANGED", "severity": "high", "escalators": ["NO_PROD_CHANGE_IN_DIFF"]}]
